l4e10_cell_thermal: layer 4 task L4-E10 (MESHSAT-1357), FEA-008: the cell and thermal design of the battery path
PROTOTYPE DESIGN, desk arithmetic; nothing bought, built, powered or measured. Classes: MAKER, MODELED, INFERRED, ASSUMPTION, CONDITIONAL.

